# The rulebook's additional strikes example, played out: Wauneka is blocked by Flávio Gonçalves
# (vekn.net/rulebook, "Additional Strikes"). Additional strikes come only after the first pair of
# strikes, at the same range, and only those who gained one strike in them.
# Cards are given by VEKN ID; names and images come from the content pack (LEGAL-08).
seed 5
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A 201573 *12
library A 102215 *20 100227 *20
crypt B 201547 *12
library B 100227 *40
crypt C 201542 *12
library C 101993 *40
start

# Fast-forward: Wauneka and Flávio are in play (sped up for the demo).
A> transfer +5 A:uncontrolled:1
A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> transfer +7 B:uncontrolled:1
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> transfer +5 C:uncontrolled:1
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion

# Wauneka bleeds Bob; Flávio blocks. Neither maneuvers, so the round is at close range.
A> bleed A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass strikes
B> pass strikes

# "Wauneka announces he is using a Roundhouse card, which allows him to inflict 4 damage, as his
# strike. Flávio Gonçalves uses his special ability to dodge as his strike, so no damage is dealt."
A> strike hand 4 via A:hand:2
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Wauneka (G6) plays Roundhouse to strike: a hand strike for 4
B> strike dodge via B:ready:1
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Flávio Gonçalves (G6) strikes with Flávio Gonçalves (G6): dodge
log public Round 1 · Damage: No strike lands

# "Wauneka plays a card giving him 1 additional strike. Flávio Gonçalves plays a card giving him 2
# additional strikes": Blur, basic and superior. The acting minion decides first.
A> strike extra via A:hand:1
log public Round 1 · Damage: Wauneka (G6) plays Blur for an additional strike
A> pass
B> strike extra via B:hand:1
log public Round 1 · Damage: Flávio Gonçalves (G6) plays Blur for an additional strike
A> pass
B> pass
log public Additional strikes: Wauneka (G6) and Flávio Gonçalves (G6)

# "Wauneka uses his hand strike for the second strike. Flávio Gonçalves uses his hand strike also.
# Both take 1 damage." Flávio takes the second strike his Blur gave him.
A> strike hand
B> strike hand
A> pass
B> strike extra
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Wauneka (G6) takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
log public Round 1 · Damage: Flávio Gonçalves (G6) takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)

# "Flávio Gonçalves then uses his hands one more time, and Wauneka cannot use a strike because he
# had only 1 additional strike. Wauneka takes 1 more damage."
log public Additional strikes: Flávio Gonçalves (G6)
reject A> strike hand
B> strike hand
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Wauneka (G6) takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
expect card A:ready:1 blood 3
expect card B:ready:1 blood 6

# Both still ready: the press step, then the end of the round.
expect combat 1 press close
A> pass round
B> pass round
expect action none
